std::regex construction + regex_match over libstdc++ <regex>.
ADDRESS-LAYOUT-DEPENDENT symex invariant violation
(lhs.type()==rhs.type() via shared_ptr _M_get_deleter): with ASLR
DISABLED (setarch -R) the run verifies 0 of 41987 (non-vacuous, ~91s);
with ASLR ENABLED it aborts 3/3.  Some front-end structure iterates in
pointer order and leaks the order into symbol/type identity.  The
deterministic ASLR switch is the diagnosis lever (2026-08-11).
